  "description": "<p>Without the burden of flesh, skeletal wolves charge across the battlefield with terrifying speed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Among the ranks of the dead, none are so numerous, nor so varied, as the skeleton. While most are almost entirely made from bone, some maintain a few scraps of flesh to aid them in movement, such as wing membranes.</p>",
